--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Scope of this license, and third-party material

This license covers the code, scripts, documentation and derived statistics
authored in this repository.

It does NOT cover the third-party image datasets the study analyzes. Those are
not redistributed here, and each remains under its own terms:

  * Kaggle "Fake vs Real Medicine" -- no license stated by its uploader; the
    listing records its license as "Unknown". Nothing from it is redistributed
    in this repository: only derived per-image statistics, split assignments
    and filenames. Obtain it from the original listing.
  * Mendeley "Mobile-Captured Pharmaceutical Medication Packages"
    (doi:10.17632/bjy2svvmn8.1) -- CC BY 4.0, attribution required.
  * Roboflow "Counterfeit_med_detection" v4 -- CC BY 4.0, attribution required.

Any artifact in this repository that would reproduce image content -- Grad-CAM
overlays, manual-review contact sheets, and the corresponding manuscript figure
-- is excluded for the same reason and is regenerated by the committed scripts
from your own copy of the source archives.
